  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 21-layer HfO2/SiO2 defect-cavity stack on Fused Silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2(0), SiO2(1), HfO2(2), SiO2(3), HfO2(4), SiO2(5), HfO2(6), SiO2(7), HfO2(8), SiO2(9), HfO2_defect(10), SiO2(11), HfO2(12), SiO2(13), HfO2(14), SiO2(15), HfO2(16), SiO2(17), HfO2(18), SiO2(19), HfO2(20). Wavelength bands: 1530-1565 nm (maximize transmittance), 400-700 nm (maximize reflectance). Bounds: layers 0-9 and 11-20 thickness 210-340 nm, layer 10 thickness 380-400 nm. Use L-BFGS-B optimizer with soft penalty on total thickness variation (target total thickness ~5500 nm, penalty weight 0.01). Initialize from uniform distribution within bounds. Evaluate at normal incidence, unpolarized light. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Maximum 30 layers.",
